      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nRock Stables is a substantial seven-bedroom detached residence, ideally positioned in a peaceful and highly sought-after setting. Set on a private site of almost 2 acres and bordered by mature trees and hedging for enhanced privacy, the property includes a large paddock to the front. This superb home enjoys panoramic views across the rolling North Wexford countryside. Conveniently located just 4.1 km from Gorey and within easy reach of the M11, it offers an ideal balance of rural tranquillity and commuter convenience.\n\nExtending to approximately 249 sq.m, the property is beautifully presented and filled with natural light, with a strong emphasis on spacious, comfortable living throughout.\n\nThe ground floor briefly comprises a large living room, kitchen, utility room, dining room, two versatile rooms suitable as bedrooms or home offices, a family bathroom, and a generous family room. Adjoining this space is a fully self-contained unit with its own private entrance, complete with bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, and utility—perfect for guests, extended family, or independent living.\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation includes four generously sized bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a substantial attic room offering excellent additional flexibility.\n\nThe house itself is accessed via two separate driveways approaching from the front and side. The front garden has been thoughtfully landscaped with a variety of mature shrubs and trees, complemented by an expansive lawn. To the rear, a stable block adds further appeal, offering excellent potential for equestrian or additional storage use or conversion. The paddock to the front offers obvious further potential."
      },
